@node Top
@top Ghostel Terminal Workflow

Ghostel terminals are managed by @file{lisp/jg-ghostel.el}, loaded by
@file{lisp/init/jg-shell.el}.  No extra terminal/window-management package
is needed.  These paths are relative to the Emacs configuration directory.

This manual describes the project/global terminal controls, independent
quake/full-frame preferences, and editor-layout restoration.

